WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.500
Did you know, creating your product photos and videos?

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:15.111
Inside Amazon's AI Studio is now possible

00:00:15.111 --> 00:00:17.000
within minutes.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:22.996
Let me show you how I use Amazon's AI tools to create pictures and videos for

00:00:22.996 --> 00:00:23.660
my brand.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:26.750
I'm Pallavi Pande, owner at Dtocs.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:31.250
At Dtocs we make sustainable tableware like your plates

00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:35.000
and bowls out of palm leaves and bamboo fiber.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.500
As a small brand with limited resources and budget,

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.000
creating professional videos and photographs used to be expensive.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:44.500
But now Amazon's creative tools

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.000
make it easier.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Amazon's AI Video Generator turns one single product image into videos automatically.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.500
These AI creative tools were designed for small businesses to develop professional advertising

00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:01.000
content without the help of agencies or studios.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.700
It took few seconds but it generated the

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.000
image.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
You go into products and add your product ASIN right here on the tab, click on generate.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
I'll show you the results.

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:33.800
So if you're an Amazon seller or product brand, AI tools like this help us create high quality

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:36.000
content quickly.
